[agent:result]         FeatureViews.
[agent:result] 
[agent:result]         Label keys and values can be no longer than 64 characters
[agent:result]         (Unicode codepoints), can only contain lowercase letters,
[agent:result]         numeric characters, underscores and dashes. International
[agent:result]         characters are allowed.
[agent:result] 
[agent:result]         See https://goo.gl/xmQnxf for more information on and examples
[agent:result]         of labels. No more than 64 user labels can be associated with
[agent:result]         one FeatureOnlineStore(System labels are excluded)." System
[agent:result]         reserved label keys are prefixed with
